# SAM Architecture — Mermaid Diagrams

## Asset Lifecycle Flow

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Request Asset] --> B[Procure/Order]
    B --> C[Receive]
    C --> D[Setup & Tag]
    D --> E[Assign to Employee]
    E --> F[Use & Maintain]
    F --> G{Needs Repair?}
    G -->|Yes| H[In Repair]
    H --> I[Return to Service]
    I --> E
    G -->|No| J{Replace?}
    J -->|Yes| K[Retire]
    J -->|No| E
    K --> L[Dispose/Recycle]
    style A fill:#e1f5fe
    style L fill:#ffcdd2
    style G fill:#fff9c4
    style J fill:#fff9c4
```

