## Common Mistakes Flow

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Buy asset without record] --> B[Can't track it]
    B --> C[Asset "disappears"]
    D[Don't track license] --> E[Overpay for software]
    F[No offboarding process] --> G[Assets leave with employees]
    H[Ignore expiration dates] --> I[Support lapses unexpectedly]
    style A fill:#ffcdd2
    style C fill:#ffcdd2
    style E fill:#ffcdd2
    style G fill:#ffcdd2
    style I fill:#ffcdd2
```

## How to Use These Diagrams

1. Copy any `graph TD` block above
2. Paste into a Mermaid-compatible viewer:
   - GitHub Markdown (renders automatically)
   - Notion (`/mermaid` block)
   - Obsidian (Mermaid plugin)
   - Draw.io / diagrams.net
   - Excalidraw
3. Export as PNG/SVG for presentations or documentation
